@AgilePredict_HostAddress = https://localhost:7194
@AgilePredict_Http = http://localhost:5240

# ====================
# HEALTH CHECKS
# ====================

### Health Check - Basic
GET {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Health Check - Detailed
GET {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### LLM API Health Check
GET {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/ai/health
Accept: application/json

# ====================
# LLM INTEGRATION TESTS
# ====================

### Test LLM Connection - Full Request
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/ai/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Explain what Agile methodology is in one sentence.",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "maxTokens": 100
}

### Test LLM Connection - Simple Text
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/ai/test/simple
Content-Type: application/json

"What is a sprint in Agile?"

### Test LLM Connection - Story Point Estimation
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/ai/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Estimate story points for this task: 'Create a REST API endpoint to fetch user data from database'. Provide a number between 1 and 13.",
  "temperature": 0.5,
  "maxTokens": 50
}

### Test LLM Connection - Sprint Planning
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/ai/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "As a Scrum Master, provide 3 tips for an effective sprint planning meeting.",
  "temperature": 0.8,
  "maxTokens": 300,
  "model": "meta-llama/llama-4-scout-17b-16e-instruct"
}

# ====================
# FLOW DIAGNOSTICS (US #211 - Alerta Preditivo de Gargalos por Status e Responsável)
# Works with any Azure DevOps organization/project the caller has access to.
# ====================

### Generate predictive flow diagnostics - via Azure Boards URL (org/project auto-detected)
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/flow-diagnostics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardsUrl": "https://dev.azure.com/eleven11C/Applied%20AI%20Engineering/_workitems/edit/211",
  "iterationPath": "Applied AI Engineering\\2026-09-Sprint-01",
  "personalAccessToken": "your-pat-here"
}

### Generate predictive flow diagnostics - via explicit organization/project
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/flow-diagnostics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organization": "eleven11C",
  "project": "Applied AI Engineering",
  "iterationPath": "Applied AI Engineering\\2026-09-Sprint-01",
  "personalAccessToken": "your-pat-here"
}

### Flow Diagnostics - Missing iterationPath (should return 400)
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/flow-diagnostics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardsUrl": "https://dev.azure.com/eleven11C/Applied%20AI%20Engineering/_workitems/edit/211"
}

### Flow Diagnostics - Neither boardsUrl nor organization/project, no server default (should return 400)
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/flow-diagnostics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iterationPath": "Applied AI Engineering\\2026-09-Sprint-01"
}

# ====================
# ERROR SCENARIOS (for testing)
# ====================

### Test LLM - Empty Prompt (should return 400)
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/ai/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "maxTokens": 100
}

### Test LLM - Invalid Temperature (should return 400)
POST {{AgilePredict_HostAddress}}/api/ai/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Test prompt",
  "temperature": 2.5,
  "maxTokens": 100
}

